PocketFFT (vendored source)
===========================
Source: https://github.com/mreineck/pocketfft
Pinned commit: 4d865cba24359b05b37da4e75aee24498c3b78e7
Files: cpp/vendor/pocketfft/pocketfft_hdronly.h and LICENSE.md
License: BSD-3-Clause
Copyright notices and the complete license text are retained in both files.

Python runtime, development, and optional GUI dependencies are not vendored
in this repository. Their version constraints are in pyproject.toml; Windows
development wheel hashes are retained in the requirements lock files.
Those packages carry their own licenses and notices in their distributions.

The optional figure extra installs Matplotlib 3.11.2; it is not vendored.
Matplotlib's project license is at
https://matplotlib.org/stable/project/license.html . Its license agreement
identifies the Matplotlib Development Team and retains contributor notices.

The Bruker digital-filter operation is original SpinFlow code implementing a
declared fractional group-delay policy also documented by nmrglue's
rm_dig_filter operation. nmrglue 0.12 is an installed, non-vendored runtime
dependency under the upstream BSD-3-Clause license:
https://github.com/jjhelmus/nmrglue/blob/master/LICENSE.txt .
No nmrglue source is copied into this repository for that operation.

The public BMRB acquisitions used by optional integration validation are fetched
at runtime to ignored local directories and are not redistributed here. Their
source URLs, byte counts, hashes, original authors and independent TopSpin
reference scope are recorded in tests/fixtures/bruker_public_manifest.json
and tests/fixtures/bruker2d_public_manifest.json. No explicit redistribution
license is inferred from the public-access statement.
BMRB's public-access policy is at https://bmrb.io/metabolomics/data_policy.shtml .
